sequenceDiagram
  participant P as primary OSD.1
  participant LR as local_reserver (OSD.1)
  participant RR as remote_reserver (OSD.7)
  participant T as backfill target OSD.7
  P->>LR: request_reservation(pg, prio=151)
  Note over LR: in_progress 1 of osd_max_backfills=1 ⇒ queued
  LR-->>P: grant after a slot is freed
  P->>T: MBackfillReserve REQUEST (prio=151)
  T->>RR: request_reservation(pg, prio=151, preempt)
  RR-->>T: grant
  T-->>P: MBackfillReserve GRANT
  P->>P: Backfilling ⇒ recover_backfill
  Note over RR: a request with prio=231 (inactive) arrives<br/>preempt_one: the 151 reservation is taken back
  T-->>P: MBackfillReserve REVOKE
  P->>P: WaitLocalBackfillReserved again
